headers {
  Origin: {{origin}}
  X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
}

docs {
  Run "Auth / Dev Login" first. It stores the session cookie in Bruno's cookie jar and saves
  the csrf_token cookie to the `csrfToken` variable, which every request sends as X-CSRF-Token.
  The Origin header comes from the `origin` environment variable (must match APP_BASE_URL).
  Requires the server to run with APP_ENV=development and AUTH_DEV_LOGIN=true.
}
